1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
It is a safety recommendation engine that uses crashes as input.

2
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The NTSB is not a crash investigation agency in the way most people think.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,600
The Go Team shows up.

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,100
The investigation takes a year or two.

5
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,100
The report is public.

6
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,100
The recommendations get adopted.

7
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,600
The next million flights are safer.

8
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,600
The Party System brings expert knowledge while keeping legal interests out.

9
00:00:07,666 --> 00:00:09,666
It is not perfect. It is not fast.

10
00:00:07,666 --> 00:00:10,166
But it is the reason aviation keeps getting safer.

